Section: 4 Results
Text: 4 Results The individual NMT systems we use as source for constructing the unfolded networks are trained us- ing AdaDelta (Zeiler, 2012) on the Blocks/Theano implementation (van Merri¨enboer et al., 2015; Bastien et al., 2012) of the standard attention- based NMT model (Bahdanau et al., 2015) with: 1000 dimensional GRU layers (Cho et al., 2014) in both the decoder and bidrectional encoder; a single maxout output layer (Goodfellow et al., 2013); and 620 dimensional embedding layers.

